# CRM module map



| Domain | API prefix | Notes |

|--------|------------|-------|

| Auth / SSO | `app/api/auth/` | login, me, SSO |

| Leads | `app/api/leads/` | CRUD, stage, score, convert, assign, follow-up |

| Lead detail | `app/leads/[id]/` | party card UI (v3.0) |

| Import | `app/api/leads/import/` | CSV/XLSX bulk (v3.0) |

| Pipeline | `app/api/pipeline/rules` | automation rules |

| Visits | `app/api/visits/` | field visits |

| Inbox | `app/api/inbox/` | communications inbox |

| Users | `app/api/users/` | team |

| MDM | `app/api/mdm/voen-lookup`, `person-lookup` | VÖEN + FIN (v3.0) |

| Events | `events/dispatch` | orchestrator |

| Internal | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind`, `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Orch Sync bind + desired-state config; `instrumentation` boot |

| Admin import UI | `app/admin/import/` | SatAdmin upload (v3.0) |

| Access matrix (CRM-RBAC-01) | `app/api/admin/roles`, `admin/roles/[code]`, `admin/roles/[code]/permissions`, `admin/users`, `auth/session/refresh-permissions`, `auth/logout`; page `/admin/access` | `Role` (`isSystem`, `cloneFromCode`, `permissionCatalogVersion`), `SatelliteAuditLog`; catalog `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`; page map `page-route-permissions.ts`; API map `api-route-permissions.ts` |

**RBAC Variant A (CRM-RBAC-01):** `getSatelliteSession()` also builds `permissions` from the role row and checks the stamped API path against `api-route-permissions.ts` (unlisted → 403). `/api/leads` and `/api/leads/[id]` assert `api:leads.read` / `api:leads.write` per method. Pages: middleware `authorizePage` + `page-route-permissions.ts`. A new staff route or page needs a catalog row in the same change. ADR crm-domain-permissions-and-rbac.

**Tenancy (CP-TENANT-01):** `organizationId` on tenant/ops models + kit Prisma extension + `requireSatelliteModule("industry_crm")` (AC-CRM-TENANT 🟡 — not live SHARED pool).
